{%- comment -%}
  A/B test bucket assignment (see app/routes/apps.proxy.ab-test.tsx and
  public/widgets/ab-test-bootstrap.js for the full mechanism) — an app
  embed rather than a copy-paste snippet like the other storefront
  widgets, because it renders NOTHING visible. The copy-paste-snippet
  pivot elsewhere in this app was specifically about avoiding a
  `position:fixed` widget colliding with a theme's own sticky header —
  that concern doesn't exist here, so a plain Theme Editor toggle is
  simpler and harder to get wrong than editing theme.liquid by hand.
{%- endcomment -%}

